    62	rows, then decide between attaching the new evidence to the existing opinion and proposing a revision. Attach new
    63	evidence that supports an existing opinion even when it is similar to evidence already attached; the sources file is a
    64	cumulative log of everything read in support of each opinion, and overlapping evidence is expected.
    65	
    66	After triage, each eligible claim cluster must yield one new-opinion or revision proposal. Skip a cluster only when it
    67	is reference material without an argued stance, or an existing opinion already covers its complete claim. Use the
