   137	"""
   138	
   139	CRITIC_SYSTEM_PROMPT = """\
   140	You are a fidelity critic. Review one draft opinion against the evidence IDs in the task.
   141	
   142	First call get_evidence with every evidence ID. If no ID resolves, answer REVISE and ask for valid evidence IDs.
   143	Mention unresolved IDs, but do not judge claims whose only source is unresolved.
   144	
   145	Read same-document context only to complete the argument that a cited row started. Treat a co-equal claim, mechanism,
   146	bound, correction, consequence, or enumeration member as part of that argument. Ignore separate arguments that only
